1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:01,367
(In Korean) You wanna die?

2
00:00:01,733 --> 00:00:03,733
[QUIRKY MUSIC PLAYING]

3
00:00:05,367 --> 00:00:06,600
Sir! Sir!

4
00:00:07,233 --> 00:00:08,433
I'm sorry!

5
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:11,600
- I'm sorry.
- What are you doing?

6
00:00:14,567 --> 00:00:15,533
[GASPS]

7
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:20,400
I'm sorry, sir.

8
00:00:22,433 --> 00:00:24,400
Uh, sir?

9
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:26,000
My shoes, please?

10
00:00:31,633 --> 00:00:32,600
(In Korean) Stupid!

11
00:00:33,033 --> 00:00:34,467
Stupid? Me?!

12
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:36,467
You're the stupid one!

13
00:00:36,467 --> 00:00:37,767
My shoes!

14
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:42,133
- [DOOR CLOSES]
- Wait-- Sir!

15
00:00:43,033 --> 00:00:44,367
Sir!

16
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:45,700
[HANNAH] Sir, the shoes!

17
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:47,767
What are you doing here?

18
00:00:49,167 --> 00:00:52,367
I just told you to get
the guest's clothes,

19
00:00:52,367 --> 00:00:53,767
not wear them!

20
00:00:56,233 --> 00:00:59,700
Take it off! We don't want
the guest to get your scabies!

21
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:01,567
What scabies, ma'am?

22
00:01:01,567 --> 00:01:03,767
I don't have scabies.

23
00:01:03,767 --> 00:01:06,767
We have the same healthy skin,
don't you think?

24
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:09,033
Thanks to the hotel AC.

25
00:01:09,333 --> 00:01:12,167
I'm sorry about that.
I was carrying so much stuff,

26
00:01:12,167 --> 00:01:14,500
so I wore some
so it'd get a bit lighter.

27
00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:16,467
But I was on my way, I'm just--

28
00:01:16,467 --> 00:01:17,633
Hush!

29
00:01:17,633 --> 00:01:19,300
Stop with the excuses.

30
00:01:19,300 --> 00:01:22,167
Take it off
before the guest sees you!

31
00:01:22,167 --> 00:01:24,500
And you,
get the rest of the clothes.

32
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:26,600
- Yes, ma'am.
- Hurry up now!

33
00:01:26,600 --> 00:01:30,100
My god!
What's wrong with my staff?

34
00:01:31,167 --> 00:01:38,033
[MELLOW MUSIC PLAYING]

35
00:01:43,333 --> 00:01:45,100
Who are you calling stupid?

36
00:01:45,567 --> 00:01:46,600
Bye!

37
00:01:59,433 --> 00:02:01,500
[SIGHS]

38
00:02:05,500 --> 00:02:06,500
Fighting!
